Varian Khan is the bookie at the fighting ring on the edge of the forsaken sector in the [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/Undercroft|Undercroft]] of [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/index|Iomenei]]. He pays the winners in ration slips, and the losers' bodies go into the vats below the grate.

He does not talk about his clientele for free. He named his price as the cost of better railings around the pit, and the party swayed him with the ration slips they carried. He told them he had seen [[People/Gerhard|Gerhard]] come and go from deeper in the sector, last the day before.
